// two CLTV-locked 2-of-3 multisig vaults, each released in 132 monthly tranches
// that auto-unlock every 5th of the month (OP_CHECKLOCKTIMEVERIFY); first unlock
// 5 Dec 2026, last 5 Nov 2037 (11 years, linear, no cliff):
//   Dev vault   : K1/K2/K3 9,600,000 CEN (outputs 0..131)
//   Owner vault : K4/K5/K6 6,900,000 CEN (outputs 132..263)
// Each output is a P2SH of <5th-of-month ms> OP_CHECKLOCKTIMEVERIFY + 2-of-3
