// on-chain) and always needs 2-of-3 signatures afterwards.
// Private keys live offline/encrypted outside this repo; public keys and the
// full schedule are published in docs/premine-cltv-schedule.md. The table below
// is generated by `cargo run -p celenium-txscript --example gen_premine_cltv`;
